{"game":"electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection","category":"parties-guilds-chat","cell":18,"verdict":"STRONG","depth":"full","donor_path":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAM.CPP","licence":"GNU GPL v3 with Electronic Arts additional terms (section 7); repo LICENSE.md","licence_class":"copyleft","target_module":"src/fight/group-brain.ts","parity_row":2,"pattern_tags":["group-refill","wait-gate","hysteresis","population-cap","new:priority-transfer","new:captain-succession"],"data_fields":[{"name":"reinforce_fraction","donor_constant":"desired / 3 (integer division)","unit":"ratio","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAM.CPP:326"},{"name":"gather_radius","donor_constant":"STRAY_DISTANCE 2 (donor distance units not verified)","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAM.H:47"},{"name":"mission_timeout_per_argument","donor_constant":"Argument * (TICKS_PER_MINUTE/10) = 90 ticks","unit":"ticks","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAM.CPP:484"},{"name":"ticks_per_second","donor_constant":"15","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/DEFINES.H:2146"},{"name":"suspend_duration","donor_constant":"TICKS_PER_MINUTE*2 = 1800 ticks","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAM.CPP:1512"},{"name":"suspend_priority_threshold","donor_constant":"20 (single caller; comment scale is 0-15)","unit":"count","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TECHNO.CPP:3779"},{"name":"recruit_priority","donor_constant":"integer, documented scale 0-15","unit":"count","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAMTYPE.H:204"},{"name":"retreat_threat_weight","donor_constant":"distance * (threat + 1)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAM.CPP:389"},{"name":"repair_retreat_factor","donor_constant":"score >>= 1 (halved)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/electronicarts-CnC_Remastered_Collection/TIBERIANDAWN/TEAM.CPP:392"}],"best_idea":"A pack gathers before it advances, centred only on members that have already arrived, and holds the arrived ones while laggards catch up; a hit from outside the pack changes its target only when the current target cannot hit back from range.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"Take the arrive-then-advance centre, the one-third reinforce and the hold-on-retarget rule for mob packs. Reject the priority-gated transfer and the suspend-and-disband for anything a player owns (no party or guild model in this donor). The donor has no attacker cap, so MAX_ATTACKERS = 3 is ours.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test with a pack of 3 mobs (desired 3, reinforcable): when one member is left the pack stops advancing and walks to its retreat point; a hit from a non-member while the current target is armed and within range of the pack centre leaves the target id unchanged; with three attackers in range the pack never has more than MAX_ATTACKERS = 3 mobs on the player at once."}
